# Facts of the confidence band classifier and verify gate (middleware_reads.update_confidence, middleware_async.maybe_verify_visual).
# The host owns the update arithmetic (decay 0.08 on write, boost 0.15 on read, clamped 0..1) and passes the already-updated value.
# conf.isWrite is accepted for documentation / INPUT coverage; the DECISION itself only inspects updatedValue.
CONTRACT unitymcp.confidence
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE confidence_facts
FACT conf.isWrite bool
FACT conf.updatedValue number min=0 max=1
INPUT confidenceBand conf.isWrite conf.updatedValue
INPUT shouldVerify conf.updatedValue
